questions.prompt:
What is the time complexity of the following loop?

for i = 1; i <= n; i = i * 2:
    do O(1) work

What is the time complexity?

for i = 1 to n:
    j = 1
    while j < n:
        j = j * 2

What is the asymptotic time complexity?

for i = 1 to n:
    for j = i to n:
        do O(1) work

What is the total number of inner-loop executions?

for i = 1 to n:
    for j = 1 to i:
        do O(1) work

What is the time complexity?

for i = 1; i <= n; i++:
    for j = 1; j <= n; j = j * 2:
        do O(1) work

What is the time complexity?

for i = 1 to n:
    for j = i; j <= n; j += i:
        do O(1) work

What is the time complexity?

for i = 1; i <= n; i++:
    for j = 1; j <= i; j *= 2:
        do O(1) work
